# Runtime dependencies for the import service, as top-level intent.
#
# requirements.txt is GENERATED from this file and must not be hand-edited:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file requirements.txt requirements.in
#
# It previously held five bare package names with no versions, no lockfile and
# no hashes, so two builds a week apart could install different code and a
# compromised release on PyPI would be pulled silently. The generated file
# pins every transitive dependency to an exact version and a SHA-256 hash,
# which pip then verifies on install.
#
# Floors reflect what this service actually relies on; pip-compile resolves
# the exact versions.
